    "id": "FI-01",
    "implementation_scope": [
      "examples/validation/"
    ],
    "model_delta_expectation": "none expected",
    "objective": "Goes FIRST AND ALONE, seeded before any measurement runs, because three tickets in a row correctly declined to seed it after seeing their numbers. GOAL-port-reach clause 2 could not be met last epic because no positive control is seeded inside a port's region, so every port-scoped kill number is a FLOOR including the headline. PA-06-DF-07 is blocking and worse: the repaired control is unobservable in one step on three of four trees AND ITS PROBE CANNOT FAIL -- a no-op reports HOLDS. Fixing the control without fixing the probe re-creates the defect. R2 applies: if it cannot be made to work on some tree, REPORT IT RED.",
